#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:5 9b7cabd8ffe34ff480ff3737224b8a46
msgid "Battery Failsafe"
msgstr "电池失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:7 006862149034494189b5b7bdb1528899
msgid ""
"The battery failsafe can be configured to automatically switch the vehicle "
"into :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`, :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` or :ref:`Land "
"<land-mode>` mode if the vehicle battery voltage drops below a specified "
"voltage for 10 seconds or the estimated remaining capacity has dropped below"
" a configurable threshold."
msgstr ""
"电池失控保护可配置为在飞行器电池电压持续 10 秒低于指定电压，或估计剩余容量低于可配置阈值时，自动将飞行器切换至 :ref:`RTL <rtl-"
"mode>`、:ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` 或 :ref:`Land <land-mode>` 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:11 b25b350c90614c3d813561d2d88a6100
msgid ""
"This failsafe requires the vehicle have a working :ref:`Power Module "
"<common-powermodule-landingpage>`."
msgstr "此失控保护要求飞行器配备可正常工作的 :ref:`电源模块 <common-powermodule-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:13 7f98d354e8114b0fb21ec4395cd250ba
msgid ""
"ArduPilot firmware versions 4.0 and later support up to 9 batteries/power "
"monitors. The discussion below applies to those optional batteries also. "
"Each can trigger a failsafe and each can have different actions and setup "
"values. In addition, a group of batteries can be treated as a single unit, "
"see ``BATTx_MONITOR`` = 10."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 固件 4.0 及更高版本支持最多 9 "
"块电池/电源监测器。以下讨论也适用于这些可选电池。每块电池都可以触发失控保护，并可设置不同的动作和参数值。此外，一组电池可作为单个单元处理，请参见 "
"``BATTx_MONITOR`` = 10。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:16 9ab19053a26c45bbbc849fc9ccd7b6b5
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "失控保护的触发时机"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:18 87115b8217ab47feb00c3f524c6eca77
msgid ""
"If enabled and set-up correctly the battery failsafe will trigger if the "
"main battery's"
msgstr "如果启用且设置正确，当主电池的以下情况发生时，电池失控保护将触发"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:20 f3ad9dafa6784fc1a5d3d0b24ccffd13
msgid ""
"voltage drops below the voltage held in the :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT "
"<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` parameter (or FS_BATT_VOLTAGE in older versions) for more "
"than 10 seconds. The default voltage is 10.5 volts. If set to zero, the "
"voltage based trigger will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"电压持续超过 10 秒低于 :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` 参数（或旧版本中的 "
"FS_BATT_VOLTAGE）所存储的电压值。默认电压为 10.5V。如果设为零，则禁用基于电压的触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:21 83e35985f42c4b3da6f7ad271a0eb538
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"remaining capacity falls below the :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` "
"parameter (or FS_BATT_MAH in older versions) 20% of the battery's full "
"capacity is a good choice (i.e. \"1000\" for a 5000mAh battery). If set to "
"zero, the capacity based trigger will be disabled (i.e. only voltage will be"
" used)"
msgstr ""
"剩余容量低于 :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` 参数（旧版本中为 "
"FS_BATT_MAH）设定值，建议设为电池总容量的 20%（例如 5000mAh 电池设为 "
"「1000」）。设为零则禁用基于容量的触发（即仅使用电压触发）。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:24 79f442137902451aa0b338fcd2ec7ecf
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "将会发生什么"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:26 27515a8547fe4777b227cdd197199b46
msgid "When the failsafe is triggered:"
msgstr "当失控保护触发时："

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:28 23ab02112cce4d8789d0bcb29a3b8cb2
msgid "Buzzer will play a loud low-battery alarm"
msgstr "蜂鸣器将发出响亮的低电量警报"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:29 1dba2c6ebe124a75870a3f97b9a251ca
msgid "LEDs will flash yellow"
msgstr "LED 将闪烁黄色"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:30 fb4111a3cbb74b59883d59aed1d7d8b2
msgid ""
"\"Low Battery!\" will be displayed on the ground stations HUD (if telemetry "
"is connected)"
msgstr "如果连接了数传，地面站 HUD 上将显示\"Low Battery！\""

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:32 665bae2a45bc40c08826df5b364a93a7
msgid "Then one of the following will happen:"
msgstr "然后将发生以下情况之一："

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:34 3a2a19b516c5422590c5c05e8c78a8aa
msgid ""
"**Nothing** if the vehicle is already disarmed or executing RTL or Land"
msgstr "**无操作**：如果飞行器已上锁或正在执行 RTL 或 Land"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:35 9af998e366614186b52d1f82b68337d5
msgid ""
"**Disarm motors** if the vehicle is in Stabilize or Acro mode and the "
"throttle is at zero OR the vehicle is landed"
msgstr "**上锁电机**：如果飞行器处于 Stabilize 或 Acro 模式且油门为零，或飞行器已降落"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:36 22a79ce78e3944aeb99faeac8c619c45
msgid ""
"The user configurable action held in the :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` parameter"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` 参数中用户可配置的动作"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:38 d4951709536d4ed3badb3c5d8cc41d5f
msgid "**0** : Warn Only - no action will be taken"
msgstr "**0**：仅警告 - 不采取任何动作"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:39 5c8e370472a34172bfc4b5a3bc81b3ba
msgid "**1** : Land - the vehicle will switch to :ref:`Land <land-mode>` mode"
msgstr "**1**：降落 - 飞行器将切换至 :ref:`Land <land-mode>` 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:40 0d8f60ed728e453681592026c97da2a7
msgid ""
"**2** : RTL - the vehicle will switch to :ref:`Return-to-Launch <rtl-mode>` "
"mode if possible but if not possible (because of no good position estimate) "
"the vehicle will :ref:`Land <land-mode>` (**Recommended**)"
msgstr ""
"**2**：RTL - 如果可能，飞行器将切换至 :ref:`返回起飞点 <rtl-mode>` 模式；如果不可能（因为没有良好的位置估计），飞行器将 "
":ref:`降落 <land-mode>` （**推荐**）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:41 77528c7f610942cda91965d9127b0147
msgid ""
"**3** : SmartRTL or RTL - the vehicle will switch to :ref:`SmartRTL "
"<smartrtl-mode>` mode if possible, if not possible (because SmartRTL's "
"position buffer is full) the vehicle will switch to :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`. "
"If RTL is also not possible (because of no good position estimate) the "
"vehicle will switch to :ref:`Land <land-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"**3**：SmartRTL 或 RTL - 如果可能，飞行器将切换至 :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` "
"模式；如果不可能（因为 SmartRTL 的位置缓冲已满），将切换至 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`。如果 RTL "
"也不可能（因为没有良好的位置估计），将切换至 :ref:`Land <land-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:42 11b99f61e866491db924d2612eb6fd72
msgid ""
"**4** : SmartRTL or Land - the vehicle will switch to :ref:`SmartRTL "
"<smartrtl-mode>` mode if possible, if not possible (because SmartRTL's "
"position buffer is full) the vehicle will switch to :ref:`Land <land-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"**4**：SmartRTL 或降落 - 如果可能，飞行器将切换至 :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` "
"模式；如果不可能（因为 SmartRTL 的位置缓冲已满），将切换至 :ref:`Land <land-mode>`"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:43 ad299f4404b8489d8e4173b04779fd5e
msgid ""
"**5** : Terminate - the vehicle will disarm the motors. This is a dangerous "
"option that should not be used in most cases"
msgstr "**5**：终止 - 飞行器将上锁电机。这是一个危险选项，大多数情况下不应使用"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:44 d32b36d6e52845f79c8b3f8b16e52366
msgid ""
"**6** : Auto DO_LAND_START or RTL - the vehicle will jump to the nearest "
"\"DO_LAND_START\" mission item or RTL if no \"DO_LAND_START\" mission item "
"has been programmed (see :ref:`common-do-land-start`)."
msgstr ""
"**6**：Auto DO_LAND_START 或 RTL - "
"飞行器将跳转到最近的\"DO_LAND_START\"任务项，如果没有编程\"DO_LAND_START\"任务项，则执行 RTL（参见 "
":ref:`common-do-land-start`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:45 d3f9fe2210674585b46a246fa26a58b0
msgid ""
"**7** : Switch to :ref:`Brake mode <brake-mode>` if it can, otherwise, "
"switch to :ref:`Land <land-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"**7**：如果可能则切换至 :ref:`Brake 模式 <brake-mode>`，否则切换至 :ref:`Land <land-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:47 6de3fea1c96847df90f54c8b675ad455
msgid ""
"As with all failsafes, the user can re-take control of the vehicle by "
"changing the flight mode switch to another mode. The battery failsafe will "
"not trigger again unless the two-layer failsafe is setup (see below)"
msgstr ""
"与所有失控保护一样，用户可以通过将飞行模式开关切换到另一个模式重新接管飞行器控制。除非设置了双层失控保护（见下文），否则电池失控保护不会再次触发"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:49 44812b9c901c44c28eb211551baa1a6a
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` parameter (Copter 4.0 and later) is a "
"bitmask parameter to select one or more options that modify the standard "
"actions of the radio, GCS, and battery failsafe. In the Mission Planner full"
" parameter list or full parameter tree, the handy checkbox popup window is "
"an easy way to set this (and any other bitmask) parameter. Be sure to go to "
"Help > Check Beta Updates to pull the latest parameter definitions first "
"while connected to the internet. The :ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` bits are "
"as follows:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 参数（Copter 4.0 "
"及更高版本）是一个位掩码参数，用于选择一个或多个修改遥控器、地面站和电池失控保护标准动作的选项。在 Mission Planner "
"的完整参数列表或完整参数树中，方便的复选框弹出窗口是设置此参数（及任何其他位掩码参数）的简便方法。在联网状态下，请先前往 Help > Check "
"Beta Updates 拉取最新参数定义。:ref:`FS_OPTIONS<FS_OPTIONS>` 的各位含义如下："

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:51 56e1b623c5c240a781fda053324697cb
msgid ""
"bit 0 set: Continue if in auto mode on :ref:`Radio Failsafe <radio-"
"failsafe>`"
msgstr "第 0 位置位：在 Auto 模式下继续执行 :ref:`遥控器失控保护 <radio-failsafe>` 时的动作"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:52 5f4daa3b033840c09cb4dbfcab2749ef
msgid ""
"bit 1 set: Continue if in auto mode on :ref:`Ground Control Station "
"Failsafe<gcs-failsafe>`"
msgstr "第 1 位置位：在 Auto 模式下继续执行 :ref:`地面站失控保护<gcs-failsafe>` 时的动作"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:53 dfdeba9cb85d4af6ab14f577af213c02
msgid ""
"bit 2 set: Continue if in guided mode :ref:`Radio Failsafe <radio-failsafe>`"
msgstr "第 2 位置位：在 Guided 模式下继续执行 :ref:`遥控器失控保护 <radio-failsafe>` 时的动作"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:54 af14f084aa514f1d8b4ad2a10733b730
msgid "bit 3 set: Continue if landing on any failsafe"
msgstr "第 3 位置位：任何失控保护时，如果正在降落则继续"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:55 98084076e9ca4ea2ac826138b70dde32
msgid ""
"bit 4 set: Continue in pilot control on :ref:`Ground Control Station "
"Failsafe<gcs-failsafe>`"
msgstr "第 4 位置位：在 :ref:`地面站失控保护<gcs-failsafe>` 时保持飞手控制"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:56 6e3abaf3d5174a0aa3335310cb0c70a4
msgid "bit 5 set: Release gripper during failsafe handling"
msgstr "置位 bit 5：在失控保护处理期间释放抓取器"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:57 4da943f50c294d96ac99114791754bdb
msgid ""
"if none of the above are set, then execute the :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` or :ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` options as "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"如果以上均未置位，则按配置执行 :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` 或 "
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` 选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:59 570c9fc5cec5443bb96fe56f07682ac7
msgid ""
"Only bitmask bit 3 & 5 affects actions taken during Battery failsafe. This "
"parameter also works in conjunction with the GCS and radio failsafe, so "
"ensure you are taking all options into account when setting this parameter."
msgstr ""
"只有位掩码的 bit 3 和 5 影响电池失控保护期间采取的动作。此参数还与地面站和遥控器失控保护协同工作，因此设置此参数时请确保考虑所有选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:63 4bb8b324477f43149678d8c6b44a0298
msgid ""
"Even if the failsafe action is set to \"None\" (i.e. :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 0) the buzzer will buzz and the LEDs will flash yellow."
" To completely disable the battery failsafe set :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT "
"<BATT_LOW_VOLT>` and :ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` to zero."
msgstr ""
"即使失控保护动作设置为\"无\"（即 :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 0），蜂鸣器也会响，LED "
"也会闪烁黄色。要完全禁用电池失控保护，请将 :ref:`BATT_LOW_VOLT <BATT_LOW_VOLT>` 和 "
":ref:`BATT_LOW_MAH <BATT_LOW_MAH>` 均设为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:67 3a26295463b44c5bb5c78e9fbec11237
msgid ""
"Once the battery failsafe has triggered, it cannot be reset until the "
"autopilot is rebooted."
msgstr "一旦电池失控保护触发，在飞控重启之前无法重置。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:70 2b926afb3ff4449fb50d8b1689ea054c
msgid "Setting up using Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:72 617128f820064c50bea6bcd9ae7cd601
msgid "On the **INITIAL SETUP \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Failsafe** page:"
msgstr "在 **INITIAL SETUP \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Failsafe** 页面："

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:74 cc81c6b4522341cb99ddf49c4d01f275
msgid ""
"If the Battery section parameters are greyed out follow instructions to "
"setup the :ref:`Power Module <common-powermodule-landingpage>`"
msgstr "如果电池部分参数显示为灰色，请按照说明设置 :ref:`电源模块 <common-powermodule-landingpage>`"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:75 962b370df329467fa62213d78f5a4e31
msgid "Set the \"Low Battery\" threshold voltage (i.e. 10.5 volts)"
msgstr "设置「低电量」阈值电压（例如 10.5V）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:76 3db4dde257be45f8b99231ec43bb33aa
msgid ""
"Set the \"Reserved MAH\" or leave as \"0\" if the failsafe should never "
"trigger based on estimated current consumed."
msgstr "设置\"保留 MAH\"，或如果永远不应基于估计消耗电流触发失控保护，则保留为\"0\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:77 df39bbb6d27d40e5a2106041b1d7e08f
msgid ""
"Select the desired behavior (Land, RTL, SmartRTL, etc) from the drop-down "
"list"
msgstr "从下拉列表中选择所需行为（降落、RTL、SmartRTL 等）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:83 06bff69344e2450ab57bd736feafc01d
msgid "Two-Layer failsafe"
msgstr "双层失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:85 572676b586764db69517879cf8b2ac26
msgid ""
"ArduPilot includes a two-layer battery failsafe. This allows setting up a "
"follow-up action if the battery voltage or remaining capacity falls below an"
" even lower threshold."
msgstr "ArduPilot 包含双层电池失控保护功能。这允许在电池电压或剩余容量降至更低阈值时设置后续操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:87 a0c28c94842f428c91dffd57c59d15aa
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` - holds the secondary (lower) voltage "
"threshold. Set to zero to disable."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CRT_VOLT <BATT_CRT_VOLT>` - 存储次级（较低）电压阈值。设为零以禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:88 b263b6ea5322462d93ebaa3cbf8798b7
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>` - holds the secondary (lower) capacity "
"threshold. Set to zero to disable."
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CRT_MAH <BATT_CRT_MAH>` - 存储次级（较低）容量阈值。设为零以禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:89 bff4e0652d0a4a948dc9bd6b330901a8
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` - holds the secondary action to "
"take. A reasonable setup would be to have :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 2 (RTL) and :ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` = "
"1 (Land)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT <BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` - 存储次级动作。合理的设置是 "
":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT <BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 2（RTL）和 :ref:`BATT_FS_CRT_ACT "
"<BATT_FS_CRT_ACT>` = 1（Land）"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:92 dab4df6ef7bf4501997205d6a8f0ad65
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "高级设置"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:94 d4f26eb0eb44436091946651ebb7669f
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_FS_VOLTSRC <BATT_FS_VOLTSRC>` allows configuring whether the raw "
"battery voltage or a sag corrected voltage is used"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_FS_VOLTSRC <BATT_FS_VOLTSRC>` 允许配置使用原始电池电压还是压降校正后的电压"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:95 ba4a6b4aa1c64d57acfa71859241316b
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_LOW_TIMER <BATT_LOW_TIMER>` can configure how long the voltage "
"must be below the threshold for the failsafe to trigger"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_LOW_TIMER <BATT_LOW_TIMER>` 可配置电压必须低于阈值多长时间才触发失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/failsafe-battery.rst:96 a7122f1123e34c7d911931d82f553b5e
msgid ""
"``BATTx_`` parameters can be setup to trigger the failsafe on other "
"batteries"
msgstr "``BATTx_`` 参数可用于为其他电池设置失控保护触发"
